  "explanation": "The question asks when the GIFF was first held. Two distinct referents are identified:\n\n1. **Geneva International Film Festival (GIFF)**: Document D1S1 states that the GIFF has been exploring cinema since 1995, and D1S2 confirms this as its inception year. This supports the answer \"1995\".\n\n2. **Guwahati International Film Festival (GIFF)**: Document D2S3 explicitly states that the first Guwahati International Film Festival was inaugurated on October 28, 2017. This supports the answer \"October 28, 2017\".\n\nThe third candidate, \"25 September 1970,\" refers to the inaugural sale at the Guwahati Tea Auction Centre (GTAC), not the GIFF. It is incorrectly labeled as such in some cards and is therefore excluded."
}
